HTab

Requirements
------------

GHC >= 6.6.1 < 6.8, alex, happy, hylolib (http://trac.loria.fr/projects/hylolib)

Installation
------------
You need to configure, build and install HTab in order to use it.
The usual steps to install HTab in your home directory are:

$ runghc Setup.lhs configure --prefix=$HOME
$ runghc Setup.lhs build
$ runghc Setup.lhs copy


Refer to the Cabal documentations for more options (http://www.haskell.org/cabal)

